      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُؤْمُورٌ</span></b>  <i>A sign,</i> or <i>mark, set up to show the way
in a waterless desert;</i> (K, TA;) <i>consisting of
stones piled up, one upon another:</i> (TA:) pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَآمِيرُ</span>. (K.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمَرَةٌ</span>.] ＝   
